    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_3C4qiwbWK4gkg06",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID33",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Q4-qwen3-embedding-8b__qwen3-reranker-8b-chunk_2dd53f36e40e471ed8a452b1",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>EDOS Label</strong></p><p><strong>1.1 threats of harm</strong> – Direct or indirect threats of harm, violence, punishment, or intimidation against women or gendered subjects.</p><br><p><strong>Paragraph</strong></p><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Section: Non-consensual Distribution of Intimate Images > Threats\n\nDeath threats and rape threats have become common and even normalized in online dialogue (Van der Wilk 2018). Research by Safety Net Canada (2013) found that threats and intimidation were the most commonly reported forms of TFGBV against victim services workers in Canada. Women journalists (Barton and Storm 2014; Jane 2018), academics (Veletsianos et al. 2018), politicians and human rights defenders (Amnesty International 2018) face rape threats and death threats online, particularly if they are speaking or writing about equality issues or typically male-dominated topics. Some have received these threats over multiple years and many receive them on a\ndaily basis. Research commissioned by Amnesty International (ibid.) demonstrated that 41 percent of women who had been harassed on Twitter felt that their physical safety was threatened on at least one occasion of online harassment. The report provided graphic examples of violent rape and death threats sent to women in the study.</div><br>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q4-qwen3-embedding-8b__qwen3-reranker-8b-chunk_2dd53f36e40e471ed8a452b1",
        "QuestionID": "QID33",
        "QuestionType": "Slider",
        "Selector": "NumberScale",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText",
          "TextPosition": "above",
          "ShowValue": true,
          "ShowStatements": true,
          "StartingValue": -1,
          "NumScalePoints": 3,
          "MobileFirst": false
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "Q4-qwen3-embedding-8b__qwen3-reranker-8b-chunk_2dd53f36e40e471ed8a452b1",
