    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_3C4qiwbWK4gkg06",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID34",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Q5-bge-m3__bge-reranker-v2-m3-chunk_b9ee7ca290e2a3e97639c489",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>EDOS Label</strong></p><p><strong>1.1 threats of harm</strong> – Direct or indirect threats of harm, violence, punishment, or intimidation against women or gendered subjects.</p><br><p><strong>Paragraph</strong></p><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Section: Glossary\n\nThis backlash increasingly manifests through gender-neutral policy frameworks that have moved beyond fringe far-right politics into mainstream discourse, obscuring the gendered nature of violence and presenting gender equality measures as either unnecessary expenditure or potentially harmful to men and society.\n\nGender-based violence\n\nGender based violence against women means violence that is directed against a woman because she is a woman or that affects women disproportionately.<sup>3</sup> Gender-based violence is understood to be a form of discrimination and a violation of the fundamental freedoms of the victim and includes violence in close relationships, sexual violence (including rape, sexual assault and harassment), trafficking in human beings, slavery, and different forms of harmful practices, such as forced marriages, female genital mutilation and so-called ‘honour crimes’. Women victims of gender-based violence and their children often require special support and protection.<sup>4</sup></div><br>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q5-bge-m3__bge-reranker-v2-m3-chunk_b9ee7ca290e2a3e97639c489",
        "QuestionID": "QID34",
        "QuestionType": "Slider",
        "Selector": "NumberScale",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText",
          "TextPosition": "above",
          "ShowValue": true,
          "ShowStatements": true,
          "StartingValue": -1,
          "NumScalePoints": 3,
          "MobileFirst": false
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "Q5-bge-m3__bge-reranker-v2-m3-chunk_b9ee7ca290e2a3e97639c489",
        "Choices": {
          "1": {
            "Display": "<h3>How relevant is the paragraph to the description of the EDOS label?</h3>"
          }
        },
