      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>EDOS Label</strong></p><p><strong>4.1 supporting mistreatment of individual women</strong> – Justifying, minimizing, or normalizing mistreatment of individual women, including victim blaming.</p><br><p><strong>Paragraph</strong></p><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Section: REFERENCES\n\n<u>Lewis, Ruth., and Rowe, Michael., Wiper, Clare., “Online Abuse of Feminists as An Emerging form of</u> <u>Violence Against Women and Girls”, The British Journal of Criminology, Volume 57, Issue 6.</u>\n\n<u>Lumsden, K., Morgan, H. (2017), Media framing of trolling and online abuse: silencing strategies,</u> <u>symbolic violence, and victim blaming, Feminist Media Studies Vol.17, No.6.</u></div><br>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q117-bge-m3__bge-reranker-v2-m3-chunk_a238eb9734e203c1ec935d94",
        "QuestionID": "QID134",
